      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091412">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091414">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091416">Move packed double precision values in xmm1 to m128 using non-temporal hint.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
